00009",1],[50,"blo00011",3],[50,"blo00012",1],[50,"blo00014",3],[50,"blo00015",1]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"私と遊んでくれるの？　やったぁー！　私、クレハ。い～～～っぱい、遊ぼうね！","en":"You'll play with me? Yay! I'm Kureha. Let's have a ton of fun!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00259_1/uni00259_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"本ばっかり読んでないでさ、今日も元気に、勝負勝負♪","en":"Don't just read books all the time—let's be energetic today too, battle battle♪"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00259_1/uni00259_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"お菓子くれるの？　やったー！　じゃあそれ、勝負に勝ったごほうびね！","en":"You'll give me sweets? Yay! Then that'll be the prize for winning the match!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00259_1/uni00259_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"そおしゃるゲームぅ？　おおっ、やったことないけどおもしろそう！","en":"A… a… \"so-sharu\" game? Oh, I've never tried it but it sounds fun!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00259_1/uni00259_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"おーっ！　遊ぼう！　今日はどこ行く？　何する？　楽しみだな～♪","en":"Ooo! Let's play! Where shall we go today? What shall we do? I'm so excited~♪"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00259_1/uni00259_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"戦いに行くの？　じゃあ私もついてくー！　強い人いるかな～、わくわく♪","en":"Going to a fight? Then I'll come too! I wonder if there'll be strong people, I'm thrilled~"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00259_1/uni00259_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"ねえねえ私と遊ばない？　勝負しよ、勝負♪","en":"Hey hey, won't you play with me? Let's have a match, match♪"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00259_1/uni00259_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"勝負に負けたらバツゲームね。ん？　私に勝ったら？　じゃあなんでも言うこと聞いてあげるよ","en":"If I lose the match, it's a penalty game. Huh? If you beat me? Then I'll do anything you say."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/